  data: {
    LLM: '1. Must follow suit. If unable, play any card (or Trump).\n2. Highest Trump wins, or highest card of the led suit.\n3. **Points**: Trick capture is based on rank (A-K-Q-J-10-9). Point cards in the entire deck total 40.',
    Player: '1. Must follow suit. If unable, play any card (or Trump).\n2. Highest Trump wins, or highest card of the led suit.\n3. **Points**: Trick capture is based on rank (A-K-Q-J-10-9). Point cards in the entire deck total 40.',
    objective: "Win more points in tricks than the other team to 'erase' a branch from your score tree.",
